## 10. TERM AND TERMINATION

  (a) **Term.** This Agreement commences on the Effective Date and
      continues until terminated in accordance with its terms.

  (b) **Termination by Licensor.** Licensor may terminate this Agreement
      immediately upon written notice if Licensee:
      (i) breaches any material term of this Agreement and fails to cure
      such breach within thirty (30) days of written notice;
      (ii) engages in any unauthorized use, distribution, or
      reverse-engineering of the Software; or
      (iii) becomes insolvent, files for bankruptcy, or ceases operations.

  (c) **Termination by Licensee.** Licensee may terminate this Agreement
      at any time by ceasing all use of the Software and destroying all
      copies as provided in Section 10(d).

  (d) **Effect of Termination.** Upon termination of this Agreement for
      any reason:
      (i) Licensee shall immediately cease all use of the Software;
      (ii) Licensee shall destroy all copies of the Software, Derivative
      Works, Documentation, and Confidential Information in its possession
      or control, and shall provide Licensor with written certification of
      such destruction within thirty (30) days; and
      (iii) All rights granted to Licensee under this Agreement shall
      immediately cease, except for those provisions that by their nature
      should survive termination (including Sections 5, 7, 8, 9, 11, and 12).

